I'm not sure what you mean by "animated text". I wouldn't expect any plugin for text effects, like per-character fade-in for Show Text, to change where the text is drawn?
The engine draws text by specifying an area and alignment, so you may need to address each case individually. Maybe someone else knows of a plugin for "full" RTL support.

